@Authenticate_User_Web_Service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5049

### Without credentials: expect 401 Unauthorized
GET {{Authenticate_User_Web_Service_HostAddress}}/api/Values

### Valid credentials (instructor01:Password01): expect 200 and two values
GET {{Authenticate_User_Web_Service_HostAddress}}/api/Values
Authorization: Basic aW5zdHJ1Y3RvcjAxOlBhc3N3b3JkMDE=

### Malformed credentials: expect 401 Unauthorized
GET {{Authenticate_User_Web_Service_HostAddress}}/api/Values
Authorization: Basic invalid-base64
